				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				102,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Sky): Display commands count in replay-events log\n\nExtend the replay mechanism in SkyBridge to surface the commands count returned by Mountain's `sky:replay-events` IPC call. Add `commands?: number` to the type definition and include it in the log summary alongside tree-views and scm providers.\n\nThis provides visibility into how many commands were replayed during the early boot phase when extension activations fire commands before the frontend is ready to receive them.",
			"SHA": "76df61374eeed487917268e4400532e9baae4bc9"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-29T03:40:07Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				102,
				2
			],
			"Message": "fix(Sky): Fix missing Activity Bar views from extension contributions\n\nTwo fixes recover the editor's Activity Bar and extension-contributed panels:\n\n1. astro.config.ts: Rollup's `\"no-external\"` default was dropping VS Code's contribution-point side-effect imports (`extensions.contribution`, `scm.contribution`, `files.contribution`, `*.viewlet.js`…) that register the workbench view containers. Add normalized path matching to catch: disk paths (`/Output/Target/...`), package specs (`@codeeditorland/output/...`), and lowercase variants. Without this, the Activity Bar comes up empty—no Extensions, SCM, or Explorer views—even though `extensions:getInstalled` returns 113 entries.\n\n2. SkyBridge.ts: Tauri's `app.emit` is fire-and-forget. During extension activation (~580 log lines before Sky finishes booting), every `sky://tree-view/create` and `sky://scm/register` is dropped before listeners install. Add a replay mechanism that calls `sky:replay-events` to drain Mountain's state and re-emit each entry idempotently. Without this, extension-contributed views (GitLens panes, jsdebug trees, SCM provider rows) stay empty despite the workbench otherwise functioning.\n\nNow the Activity Bar populates correctly and extension-contributed tree views bind their data providers.",
			"SHA": "b4dc48c557dc635bcb1b9a763684285db94e912c"
		},
		{
